      - This is a single-file prototype for a complex survival game.
      - It includes:
      - Procedural Chunk-Based World (Biomes, Difficulty Rings)
      - Procedural Building/POI Generation
      - Player Survival Stats (Health, Hunger, Thirst, Stamina, Morale)
      - Zombie AI (FSM, Sight/Sound Sensors, State Icons)
      - Drivable Vehicles with Fuel and Durability
      - Base Building System with Power Grid
      - Tiered Item & Loot System (T1-T4)
      - Day/Night Cycle
      - Complex UI Panels (Inventory, Crafting, Storage)
    -->
